sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Task as Task Service
    participant Kafka
    participant Search as Search Service
    participant Offer as Offer Service

    Customer->>Gateway: Submit task request
    Gateway->>Task: Forward authenticated request
    Task->>Task: Validate and persist task
    Task-->>Gateway: Creation result
    Gateway-->>Customer: HTTP response

    opt If task-created event is implemented
      Task->>Kafka: Publish task-created event
      Kafka-->>Search: Deliver event
      Search->>Search: Index or match task
      opt If matching event and offer consumer exist
        Search->>Kafka: Publish matching result
        Kafka-->>Offer: Deliver matching result
        Offer->>Offer: Create or prepare offers
      end
    end
